            <ArticleTitle>[Pharmacologic possibility of limiting the energy-dependent accumulation of calcium by mitochondria of the ischemic myocardium].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>27-9</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>In experiments with total ischemia of the isolated rat heart it was found that a preliminary administration of preparations with malonate-like action to the animals exerts, unlike isoptin, cold-like effect on the time-course of calcium levels in mitochondria of the ischemic myocardium and limits the process of accumulation and release of calcium by organelles.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
